#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:3
#: 42966a7598df41e7aec1f773e984fb5c
msgid ""
"在 UniKT 中添加自定义数据集，遵循\"定义 → 注册 → 使用\"三步法。数据集通过继承 ``DataSource`` 基类实现，使用 "
"Polars 作为数据处理引擎。"
msgstr ""
"Adding a custom dataset to UniKT follows a three-step approach: \"define → register "
"→ use\". Datasets are implemented by subclassing the ``DataSource`` base class, using "
"Polars as the data processing engine."

