msgid ""
"创建数据源类，继承 ``DataSource``，实现三个核心抽象方法。它们按固定顺序被调用：``load_src_data`` → "
"``clean_raw_data`` → ``transform_data``。"
msgstr ""
"Create a data source class that subclasses ``DataSource`` and implements the three "
"core abstract methods. They are called in a fixed order: ``load_src_data`` → "
"``clean_raw_data`` → ``transform_data``."

