msgid "``get_metadata``"
msgstr "``get_metadata``"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:9
#: 9024a3de3d554d3cb3b2827815bc98ac
msgid "返回数据集元信息（技能数、题目数等）"
msgstr "Return dataset metadata (number of skills, questions, etc.)"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:149
#: 1d08d8054e6b4b62887b15b5d05b5199
msgid "这两个 ID 映射方法确保所有 ID 在 ``[0, N-1]`` 范围内且连续，模型可以直接用它们做 Embedding 索引。"
msgstr ""
"These two ID mapping methods ensure all IDs are within the ``[0, N-1]`` range and "
"consecutive, so models can use them directly as embedding indices."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:151
#: e90b2b18470c42d2bfe7e8ff03ebf58a
msgid "关系表规范"
msgstr "Relation table specification"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:153
#: 6dfe74647deb499cb8e652b8a05f8b01
msgid ""
"``self.relation_data`` 必须包含 ``question_skill``（题目-技能映射，列为 ``question`` 和 "
"``skill``），可选 "
"``question_assignment``（题目-作业映射）、``question_template``（题目-模板映射）。每个关系表为 2 "
"列 DataFrame，且 2 列的组合必须唯一。"
msgstr ""
"``self.relation_data`` must contain ``question_skill`` (question-skill mapping, with "
"columns ``question`` and ``skill``); optionally ``question_assignment`` "
"(question-assignment mapping) and ``question_template`` (question-template mapping). "
"Each relation table is a 2-column DataFrame, and the combination of the two columns "
"must be unique."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:155
#: 50fc5e2eb2434323b3994b48cc7ad29f
msgid "数据格式要点"
msgstr "Data format key points"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:157
#: 27439aa5b1f84f91aa1470294e078ff6
msgid "全程使用 **Polars** DataFrame/Parquet（非 pandas）"
msgstr "Use **Polars** DataFrame/Parquet throughout (not pandas)"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:158
#: 8f2f06163c364a8e8c7cb7b155af373c
msgid "原始数据建议用 ``lazy`` 加载以节省内存"
msgstr "Raw data is recommended to be loaded with ``lazy`` to save memory"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:159
#: 561406af5e9240ef965cfa76ff518468
msgid "``sequence_data`` 必须包含：``user``、``question``、``label``、``timestamp``"
msgstr "``sequence_data`` must contain: ``user``, ``question``, ``label``, ``timestamp``"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:160
#: 5853b918a899420993d68c61453932c2
msgid "所有 ID 列需要重映射为 ``[0, N-1]`` 的连续整数"
msgstr "All ID columns must be remapped to consecutive integers in ``[0, N-1]``"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:161
#: 410001a88a074ffbb9049abcfe278af6
msgid "``timestamp`` 应为相对时间（毫秒级 Unix 时间戳或序号）"
msgstr "``timestamp`` should be a relative time (millisecond-level Unix timestamp or sequence number)"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:163
#: 74735640a8184568a953b4d4c0bcb722
msgid "下载与序列化"
msgstr "Download and serialization"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:165
#: 620ad1caf54d43d39459388c2f187646
msgid ""
"``fetch_data``、``save_data``、``add_kfold_labels`` 和 "
"``build_split_question_sequence_data`` / "
"``build_split_skill_sequence_data`` 由基类提供，子类通常无需重写。"
msgstr ""
"``fetch_data``, ``save_data``, ``add_kfold_labels`` and "
"``build_split_question_sequence_data`` / "
"``build_split_skill_sequence_data`` are provided by the base class; subclasses usually "
"do not need to override them."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:167
#: 4282cce2d6dd4d33a8a311587ef932bf
msgid "**``save_data``** 将序列数据和关系表写入 Parquet 文件，同时执行数据一致性验证："
msgstr ""
"**``save_data``** writes sequence data and relation tables to Parquet files and runs "
"data consistency validation at the same time:"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:169
#: 55ce876770224f68b0c0ae24c4093299
msgid "**关系表校验**：每个关系表必须恰好 2 列，且 2 列的组合唯一"
msgstr ""
"**Relation table validation**: each relation table must have exactly 2 columns, and "
"the combination of the two columns must be unique"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:170
#: 97322085d054436b8df34a18f479e9a6
msgid "**``question_skill`` 必须存在**，且其列必须是 ``question`` 和 ``skill``"
msgstr "**``question_skill`` must exist**, and its columns must be ``question`` and ``skill``"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:171
#: d89616e955bb49f18707a455c3b2037d
msgid ""
"**题目 ID 交叉校验**：``sequence_data`` 中的每个 ``question`` 值必须在 "
"``question_skill`` 中存在对应条目"
msgstr ""
"**Question ID cross-validation**: every ``question`` value in ``sequence_data`` must "
"have a corresponding entry in ``question_skill``"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:172
#: 86480f1d1ac54772bfe7a70d9d07442b
msgid "**MD5 校验**：每份输出的 Parquet 文件自动计算 MD5 写入 ``metadata.json``"
msgstr ""
"**MD5 checksum**: each output Parquet file has its MD5 computed automatically and "
"written to ``metadata.json``"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:174
#: 0139fe0b16c24911a6a608a7e9c0572d
msgid "验证失败会抛出 ``AssertionError``，阻止不完整的数据进入训练管线。"
msgstr ""
"A validation failure raises an ``AssertionError``, preventing incomplete data from "
"entering the training pipeline."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:176
#: 0ae536715545482aab4c2347b8de990f
msgid "第二步：注册数据源"
msgstr "Step 2: Register the data source"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:178
#: ac8f8dd0e158403ba10e5ed8ad666eaf
msgid "使用 ``@register_data_source(\"NAME\")`` 装饰器注册。装饰器参数必须是字符串字面量，不能使用变量。"
msgstr ""
"Register with the ``@register_data_source(\"NAME\")`` decorator. The decorator "
"argument must be a string literal; variables are not allowed."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:180
#: dc65986eca38470eb874c5831582dd73
msgid "注册后，将新文件导入到 ``utils/data_process/__init__.py`` 中："
msgstr "After registration, import the new file into ``utils/data_process/__init__.py``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:187
#: cce6c71cff5b46cea110631bbdb67429
msgid ""
"这一步是必需的——框架启动时会导入 ``utils.data_process`` 包，触发 ``@register_data_source`` "
"装饰器的执行。"
msgstr ""
"This step is required — at framework startup the ``utils.data_process`` package is "
"imported, which triggers execution of the ``@register_data_source`` decorator."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:189
#: 97620fc9b1e84dd88709ca9cdfa11e18
msgid "第三步：使用数据集"
msgstr "Step 3: Use the dataset"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:191
#: 30dfdce7c72e47caac1238032281feb8
msgid "自定义数据集注册后，使用方式与内置数据集完全一致。"
msgstr "Once a custom dataset is registered, it is used exactly like a built-in dataset."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:193
#: 58757ae79b404063ae7d5030918c27c3
msgid "下载数据"
msgstr "Download data"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:206
#: aa8042288b364caa9b6aa1dc113b3762
msgid "预处理数据"
msgstr "Preprocess data"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:222
#: 1ba062c8828545bf88658698b637aa17
msgid "处理完成后在 ``data/my_dataset/`` 下生成："
msgstr "After processing completes, the following are generated under ``data/my_dataset/``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:235
#: 6c9672047eb64f1bb76aa3f5a9858b9b
msgid "训练模型"
msgstr "Train a model"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:245
#: 8b09411a5d1245fca996743ad678685d
msgid "预测位提取"
msgstr "Prediction position extraction"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:247
#: 67fb329aacac4b80b66f32ac712a9ef5
msgid "K 折划分的核心规则是**以用户为粒度划分**，而非按交互时间点。``add_kfold_labels`` 的实现逻辑如下："
msgstr ""
"The core rule of K-fold splitting is **splitting at user granularity**, not by "
"interaction time point. The implementation logic of ``add_kfold_labels`` is as follows:"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:272
#: 4ee18fefd27846328c451497cc1adf8b
msgid "**关键防护点：**"
msgstr "**Key safeguards:**"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:274
#: a796f9a7c9d84fb287c5b1cfd0b70246
msgid "划分的最小单位是用户（``user``），不是单次交互。一个用户的所有历史交互必然整块落入同一折"
msgstr ""
"The minimum unit of splitting is the user (``user``), not a single interaction. All "
"historical interactions of a user necessarily fall into the same fold as a whole"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:275
#: 46cd3d62c7f848abb6ae00a9bd546010
msgid "训练时，当前折的验证集用户在构建关系矩阵和计算题目难度时被显式排除"
msgstr ""
"During training, validation-set users of the current fold are explicitly excluded "
"when building relation matrices and computing question difficulty"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:276
#: adf943230e2a4a22b9c01b922f01badf
msgid "随机种子固定（``--seed 42``）：使用独立的 ``np.random.RandomState`` 确保同一数据集不同次运行的折分配一致"
msgstr ""
"Fixed random seed (``--seed 42``): uses an independent ``np.random.RandomState`` to "
"ensure fold assignment is consistent across runs of the same dataset"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:277
#: c670dd22533a4fd99f1b5eb1c5fb7ba8
msgid "``fold = -1`` 的测试集用户在训练过程中完全不可见，仅在最终测试评估阶段出现"
msgstr ""
"Test-set users with ``fold = -1`` are completely invisible during training and appear "
"only in the final test evaluation phase"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:280
#: 6af449bc048e4084ab0cb9a175286bbf
msgid ""
"如果需要在数据划分前对部分用户进行子采样，应在 ``clean_raw_data`` 或 ``transform_data`` "
"中完成，确保采样发生在折标签分配之前。"
msgstr ""
"If you need to subsample some users before data splitting, do it in "
"``clean_raw_data`` or ``transform_data`` to ensure sampling happens before fold-label "
"assignment."

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:283
#: d09ed78d6b3b44a18d50479798bd1abe
msgid "序列切分与 ID 重映射"
msgstr "Sequence splitting and ID remapping"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:285
#: d695e19570764bff9b7cf3b13f107ec2
msgid ""
"基类的 ``build_split_question_sequence_data`` 和 "
"``build_split_skill_sequence_data`` 负责将长用户序列切分为固定长度的子序列："
msgstr ""
"The base class's ``build_split_question_sequence_data`` and "
"``build_split_skill_sequence_data`` split long user sequences into fixed-length "
"subsequences:"

#: ../../source/advanced/customize-dataset.md:287
#: 20d9829b2c0340f38eb6e50922a19f82
msgid "按 ``max_seq_len`` 将每个用户的交互序列切分为多个子序列"
